 "bbox": [0.206, 0.581, 0.772, 0.599], "content": "\\{B _ {1} \\cap B _ {i}, B _ {2} \\cap B _ {i}, \\dots , B _ {i - 1} \\cap B _ {i}, B _ {i + 1} \\cap B _ {i}, \\dots , B _ {v} \\cap B _ {i} \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.054, 0.608, 0.444, 0.626], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v - 1, k, k - 1, \\lambda, \\lambda - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "-设计。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.054, 0.661, 0.525, 0.683], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3.6 组合数学在信息安全中的应用"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.101, 0.718, 0.371, 0.735], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. Hash 函数及其组合基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.053, 0.745, 0.926, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在第 2 章介绍数字签名标准 DSS 时, 曾提到过 Hash 函数的概念。Hash 函数又称杂凑函数, 是将任意长度的消息压缩为固定长度的消息摘要 (杂凑值)。Hash 主要用于检测网络通信信息是否被篡改, 它是保障数字签名、身份认证等多种密码系统安全的关键技术。最早的杂凑函数并不是用于密码学, 而是提取消息的关键词并将这些关键词打乱产生一些新的数据, 这些数据可以作为查找原始消息的索引, 通过构造杂凑表就可以进行存储和查找。1979 年, Merkle 首次给出了单向杂凑函数的实质性定义, 包含了抗原像攻击和第二原像攻击的安全属性, 以提供安全可靠的认证服务。1987 年, Damgard 给出了抗碰"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 139, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.407, 0.057, 0.569, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.852, 0.059, 0.889, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "127"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.092, 0.924, 0.165], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "撞攻击的杂凑函数的正式定义,指出了抗碰撞性和抗第二原像性,并将它用于设计安全的数字签名方案。这些能够提供密码服务的 Hash 函数通常称为密码 Hash 函数或者安全 Hash 函数,简称为 Hash 函数。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.055, 0.174, 0.923, 0.22], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "密码学上对 Hash 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 给出了如下定义: 对任意长的输入消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 容易计算其 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 比特长的杂凑值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = H(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并满足如下三个条件:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.099, 0.229, 0.922, 0.248], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 单向性(抗原像攻击)。给定输出值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 计算输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = H(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是困难的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.057, 0.256, 0.923, 0.302], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 弱抗碰撞性 (抗第二原像攻击)。给定输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 计算另一个输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x) = H(x')"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是困难的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.055, 0.312, 0.921, 0.358], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 强抗碰撞性(抗碰撞攻击)。寻找两个不同的输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x) = H(x')"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是困难的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.054, 0.366, 0.926, 0.609], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一个安全的 Hash 函数, 应当具有理想的抗原像攻击能力、抗第二原像攻击能力和抗碰撞攻击能力。从理论上来说, Hash 函数将任意长度的消息压缩为固定长度的消息摘要, 它通常是一个多对一的函数。如果消息摘要是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " bit 的话, 那么任取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同的消息输入, 一定存在某个输入值, 其对应的输出值一定为给定的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。因此, 抗原像攻击的计算复杂度应该为搜索攻击的复杂度, 也就是说, 穷尽搜索长度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " bit 的每一个输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 计算函数值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 检查 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和给定的输出值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否相等? 这种搜索最坏情况是找遍全部 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个输入值, 故搜索攻击的复杂度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而抗原像攻击的计算复杂度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。类似地, 抗第二原像攻击的复杂度也为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。但如何界定抗碰撞攻击的计算复杂度呢? 下面以组合数学为工具, 指出抗碰撞攻击的计算复杂度是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 而不是搜索复杂度 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.056, 0.625, 0.926, 0.699], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.34 已知 Hash 函数 H 的所有可能的输出值为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个, 即该 Hash 函数的消息摘要为 m bit, y 是一个给定的输出值。如果对 H 随机地取 k 个输入, 则至少有 1 个输入值 x, 使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x) = y"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的概率为 0.5, k 有多大?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.056, 0.715, 0.927, 0.846], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 因为 Hash 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个可能的输出, 所以输入值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 产生的输出值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 等于给定值 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 / n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 反过来讲, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x) \\neq y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 - 1 / n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值输入取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个随机值而函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个输出值中没有一个等于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其概率等于每个输出都不等于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率之积, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(1 - 1 / n)^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 因此 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个随机值得到函数的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个输出值中至少有 1 个等于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 - (1 - 1 / n)^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。注意到当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 充分小时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(1 + a)^{k} \\approx 1 + ak"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.296, 0.855, 0.686, 0.872], "content": "1 - (1 - 1 / n) ^ {k} = 1 - (1 - k / n) = k / n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.057, 0.883, 0.507, 0.901], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "若使上述概率等于0.5，那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = n / 2 = 2^{m - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.101, 0.912, 0.925, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "前面已经讲过,抗原像攻击和抗第二原像攻击的复杂度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 即最坏情况下, 需要遍"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 140, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.105, 0.054, 0.143, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "128"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.426, 0.052, 0.588, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.069, 0.087, 0.943, 0.216], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "历 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个全部输入值才可以找到给定输出的原像或者第二原像。根据例3.34，在实际攻击的时候，未必一定要以概率1的方式去找原像或者第二原像，只要寻找的概率超过0.5，就认为寻找算法是可行的。基于例3.34的攻击称为第一类生日攻击，它表示从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个人中随机选取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个人，这 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个人中至少有1个人的生日是某一给定日子的可能性超过一半的最小"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值应该是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n / 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.071, 0.231, 0.942, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.35 已知 Hash 函数 H 的所有可能的输出值为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 2^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个, 即该 Hash 函数的消息摘要为 m bit, 如果对 H 随机地取 k 个输入值, 则至少有 2 个输入值 x 和 y, 使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "H(x) = H(y)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的概率为 0.5, k 有多大?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.071, 0.32, 0.943, 0.449], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 记  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示 k 个随机输入中至少有 2 个的输出值相同的概率,  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q(n,k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  表示 k 个随机输入中任意 2 个的输出值都不相同的概率, 则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,k)=1-Q(n,k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。下面计算  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q(n,k)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 当 k>n 时, k 个随机输入中至少有 2 个的输出值相同, 这时  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Q(n,k)=0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 从而  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,k)=1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。当  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k \\leqslant n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  时, k 个随机输入中任意 2 个的输出值都不相同的所有取值方式的个数为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.244, 0.458, 0.77, 0.49], "content": "n \\times (n - 1) \\times (n - 2) \\times \\dots \\times (n - k + 1) = \\frac {n !}{(n - k) !}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.072, 0.5, 0.942, 0.574], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即第一个数据项可以从 n 个中任取一个, 第二个数据项可在剩余的 n-1 个中任取一个, 依次类推, 最后一个数据项可以从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n-k+1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个值中任取一个。注意到 k 个随机输入的全部取值方式共有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.239, 0.583, 0.776, 0.617], "content": "Q (n, k) = \\frac {n !}{(n - k) ! n ^ {k}} \\quad P (n, k) = 1 - \\frac {n !}{(n - k) ! n ^ {k}}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.074, 0.629, 0.573, 0.648], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果要求 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P(n,k) = 0.5"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，可得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = 1.18\\sqrt{n}\\approx \\sqrt{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.073, 0.657, 0.943, 0.763], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.35 表明 k 个随机输入中至少有 2 个的输出值相同的概率超过 0.5 的最小 k 值大约为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sqrt{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，也就是说在平均意义下，取  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sqrt{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个输入值，很可能就有 2 个的输出值相同，因此碰撞攻击的复杂度为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。基于例 3.35 的攻击称为第二类生日攻击，它表明 n 个人中任取 k 个人，至少有 2 个人是同一天生日的可能性大于 0.5 的最小 k 值。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.074, 0.771, 0.944, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面给出第二类生日攻击对基于 Hash 的数字签名的安全性威胁。假设签名者利用签名密钥对消息 M 的 Hash 值  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m = H(M)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  进行了签名, 攻击者利用第二类生日攻击伪造签名, 其有如下做法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.074, 0.852, 0.944, 0.925], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 攻击者对签名者发送的消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 产生出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个变形的消息, 每一个变形的消息本质上的含义与原消息相同, 同时攻击者还准备一个假冒消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M'"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并对假冒消息产生出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个变形的消息。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 141, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.407, 0.058, 0.569, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.851, 0.06, 0.887, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "129"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.055, 0.093, 0.922, 0.168], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: 攻击者在产生的 2 个消息集合中, 找出杂凑值相同的一对消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 由第二生日攻击可知, 攻击者成功的概率大于 0.5 。如果不成功, 则重新产生 1 个假冒的消息, 并产生 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{m/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个变形, 直到找到杂凑值相同的一对消息为止。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.057, 0.178, 0.921, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 攻击者将消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 提交给签名者签名, 由于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 具有相同的杂凑值, 故可以将签名者对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的签名当做对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的签名, 此签名连同消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 一起发给接收者。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.101, 0.235, 0.902, 0.253], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 Hash 函数的杂凑值是 64 bit, 则攻击者攻击成功所需的时间复杂度为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "O(2^{32})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.057, 0.263, 0.924, 0.337], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Hash 函数的设计与分析是信息安全领域中的热点问题。Hash 函数的设计有多种方式, 其中一种方式就是基于分组密码设计的 Hash 函数。下面给出基于美国高级加密标准 AES 设计 Hash 的方案。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.056, 0.345, 0.926, 0.503], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第2章已经介绍了AES算法的原理及其代数基础,标准的AES算法是一个明文分组长度、密文分组长度和密钥规模均为128 bit的分组密码算法,通过10轮变换来实现明文到密文的数据替换。每一轮变换又由字节替换、行移位、列混合和密钥加构成(注意最后一轮不含列混合),其中字节替换是非线性变换,其他三种变换是线性变换。将AES算法按如下的工作模式对消息进行加密处理就可以产生消息摘要,这种工作模式通常称为分组密码的CBC工作模式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.058, 0.511, 0.925, 0.585], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 将任意长的二进制消息序列 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 按照 128 bit 进行分组, 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的长度不是 128 的倍数, 则在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的最后适当添加一些数据使得其长度恰好是 128 的倍数。不妨设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{l}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{i} \\in F_{2}^{128}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.059, 0.594, 0.927, 0.642], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: 取定一个 128 bit 的初始值 IV, 将 IV 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 进行模 2 加运算, 其结果作为 AES 算法的明文输入, 经 AES 算法加密产生密文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_{1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.058, 0.652, 0.927, 0.728], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = 2, 3, \\cdots, l"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 重复如下操作, 将 AES 算法产生的密文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_{k-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和消息块数据 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 进行模 2 加运算, 其结果又作为 AES 算法的明文输入, 经 AES 算法加密产生新的密文 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_k"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.104, 0.737, 0.868, 0.755], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4: 最后产生的 128 bit 密文块 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_l"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就作为消息 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的杂凑值, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y_l = H(M)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.059, 0.765, 0.929, 0.866], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上面介绍了如何通过分组密码的 CBC 模式来设计 Hash 函数。实际工作中采用的 Hash 函数大都是采用专用方式设计的,没有基于任何假设,也没有使用任何密码体制,主要通过字的逻辑运算、循环移位和模加运算来实现的,如著名的 Hash 函数 MD5 和 SHA-1 等。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.105, 0.883, 0.372, 0.9], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. Bent 函数及其组合基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.105, 0.912, 0.929, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 3.11 设 f 是从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n} \\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的一个函数。如果对于任意的非零元素  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\in F_{2}^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，映射"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 142, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.099, 0.053, 0.135, 0.066], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "130"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.418, 0.052, 0.58, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.356, 0.087, 0.64, 0.105], "content": "D _ {f, a} (x) = f (x + a) + f (x)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.062, 0.113, 0.931, 0.16], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "是平衡的, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left|\\{x \\mid D_{f,a}(x) = 0\\}\\right| = \\left|\\{x \\mid D_{f,a}(x) = 1\\}\\right| = 2^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 就称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个 Bent 函数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.065, 0.175, 0.932, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 3.36 设 n = 2m 为偶数, 其中 m 为正整数。那么  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中的向量 x 就可以记为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x_{1}, x_{2}, \\cdots, x_{m}, x_{m+1}, \\cdots, x_{2m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。于是可以定义布尔函数"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.263, 0.229, 0.734, 0.248], "content": "f (\\boldsymbol {x}) = x _ {1} x _ {m + 1} + x _ {2} x _ {m + 2} + \\dots x _ {m - 1} x _ {2 m - 1} + x _ {m} x _ {2 m}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.063, 0.255, 0.399, 0.274], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "通过简单的计算,可以进一步得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.205, 0.284, 0.79, 0.323], "content": "D _ {f, a} (\\boldsymbol {x}) = f (\\boldsymbol {x} + a) + f (\\boldsymbol {x}) = \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {m} (x _ {i} \\boldsymbol {a} _ {m + i} + x _ {m + i} a _ {i}) + f (\\boldsymbol {a})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.064, 0.328, 0.931, 0.375], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "显然， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{f,a}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是向量空间  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上的一个仿射函数。于是，当 a 是非零向量时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{f,a}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  就是平衡的。所以，根据定义 3.12，f 是一个 Bent 函数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.062, 0.383, 0.932, 0.456], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "细心的读者可能会问，n 为奇数时是否存在 Bent 函数呢？事实上，可以证明 n 必须是一个偶数。在接下来的部分里，将证明这个结论。首先介绍 Bent 函数与前面所学到的差集之间的联系。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.063, 0.471, 0.931, 0.547], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 3.17 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n} \\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的函数。那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个 Bent 函数当且仅当集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{x \\in F_{2}^{n} \\mid f(x) = 0\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是加法群 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(F_{2}^{n}, +)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的参数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(2^{n}, 2^{n-1} + 2^{n/2-1}, 2^{n-2} + 2^{n/2-1})-"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的差集，或者是参数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(2^{n}, 2^{n-1} - 2^{n/2-1}, 2^{n-2} - 2^{n/2-1})-"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的差集。因此，这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 必须为偶数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.063, 0.555, 0.932, 0.627], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为了给出定理 3.16 的证明,在这里介绍一个新的工具——群环,这一工具可以帮助简化一些烦琐的集合运算。设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个群, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{K}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为任意一个域(在本节中只需要有理数域 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Q}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "),群环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{K}[G]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 定义为如下的形式和"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.434, 0.636, 0.561, 0.669], "content": "R = \\sum_ {g \\in G} a _ {g} g"}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.064, 0.671, 0.205, 0.689], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{g}\\in \\mathbb{K}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.108, 0.696, 0.728, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "群环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{K}[G]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上两个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R = \\sum_{g\\in G}a_{g}g"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S = \\sum_{g\\in G}b_{g}g"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的和定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.378, 0.735, 0.619, 0.767], "content": "R + S = \\sum_ {g \\in G} (a _ {g} + b _ {g}) g"}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.064, 0.769, 0.23, 0.787], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "它们的积定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.295, 0.799, 0.7, 0.833], "content": "RS = \\sum_ {g, h \\in G} a _ {g} b _ {h} \\cdot g h = \\sum_ {g \\in G} \\left[ \\sum_ {h \\in G} a _ {g h ^ {- 1}} b _ {h} \\right] g"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.065, 0.837, 0.932, 0.883], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "群环从加法结构上看,类似于大家学过的向量空间(严格地说,它在 K 的作用下构成了一个自由模)。熟悉形式幂级数的读者,也可以将这两个概念之间的异同来进行对比。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.108, 0.891, 0.934, 0.925], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "群 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中任意的子集 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 都可以自然地看成是群环 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{K}[G]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的一个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum_{d \\in D} d"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 显然群 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 143, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.399, 0.061, 0.562, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.844, 0.062, 0.88, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "131"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.047, 0.096, 0.275, 0.129], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "本身就可以视为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum_{g\\in G}g"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.092, 0.132, 0.452, 0.165], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "另外，对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R = \\sum_{g\\in G}a_{g}g"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这里定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.391, 0.167, 0.567, 0.2], "content": "R ^ {(- 1)} = \\sum_ {g \\in G} a _ {g} g ^ {- 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.048, 0.203, 0.55, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "容易验证 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G^{(-1)} = G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(A + B)^{(-1)} = A^{(-1)} + B^{(-1)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.093, 0.237, 0.6, 0.256], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理3.3 记群 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的单位元为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D \\subseteq G"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，那么"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.093, 0.265, 0.286, 0.282], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "DG = |D|G;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.093, 0.292, 0.768, 0.31], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v, k, \\lambda)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "-差集，当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "DD^{(-1)} = (k - \\lambda) \\cdot e + \\lambda \\cdot G"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.05, 0.326, 0.914, 0.372], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 第一个公式的证明其实很简单, 只要注意到, 对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中任何一个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "h"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 都有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\{hg \\mid g \\in G\\} = G"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.16, 0.379, 0.805, 0.413], "content": "D G = \\sum_ {d \\in D} d \\sum_ {g \\in G} g = \\sum_ {d \\in D} \\sum_ {g \\in G} d g = \\sum_ {d \\in D} \\sum_ {g \\in G} g = | D | \\sum_ {g \\in G} g = | D | G"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.092, 0.416, 0.506, 0.434], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于第二个结论,首先展开等式的左边,即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.261, 0.445, 0.702, 0.484], "content": "D D ^ {(- 1)} = \\sum_ {d \\in D} d \\sum_ {d \\in D} d ^ {- 1} = \\sum_ {d \\in D} 1 \\cdot e + \\sum_ {d, c \\in D} ^ {d \\neq c} d c ^ {- 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.048, 0.49, 0.916, 0.55], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据差集的定义，D 是一个  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(v,k,\\lambda)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " -差集，当且仅当  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum_{d,c\\in D}^{d\\neq c}dc^{-1}=\\lambda\\sum_{g\\in G,g\\neq e}g"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。于是上式变为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k\\cdot e+\\lambda\\cdot(G\\backslash\\{e\\})=(k-\\lambda)\\cdot e+\\lambda\\cdot G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.048, 0.557, 0.917, 0.63], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "现在,再回到 Bent 函数。此时群 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (F_{2}^{n}, +)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 单位元是零向量 0 。对于任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R \\in \\mathbb{K}[G]"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 容易看出来 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "R^{(-1)} = R"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 因为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的加减法是一致的。通过群环, 可以直接根据 Bent 函数的定义证明下面的引理 3.4 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.094, 0.646, 0.563, 0.664], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理3.4 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是从 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n} \\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个函数，定义"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.184, 0.679, 0.78, 0.699], "content": "D = \\{x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n} \\mid f (x) = 0 \\} \\quad D = \\{x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n} \\mid f (x) = 1 \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.049, 0.708, 0.401, 0.726], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个Bent函数，当且仅当"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.321, 0.737, 0.914, 0.76], "content": "D \\bar {D} ^ {(- 1)} + \\bar {D} D ^ {(- 1)} = 2 ^ {n - 1} (G - 0)\\tag{3.1}"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.281, 0.774, 0.914, 0.794], "content": "D D ^ {(- 1)} + \\bar {D} \\bar {D} ^ {(- 1)} = 2 ^ {n - 1} (G - 0) + 2 ^ {n} \\cdot 0\\tag{3.2}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.095, 0.804, 0.853, 0.822], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "该引理的证明比较容易,留给读者当做一个练习。下面给出定理 3.16 的证明。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.051, 0.844, 0.917, 0.9], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 (必要性)令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D = \\{x\\in F_2^n\\mid f(x) = 0\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D = \\{x\\in F_2^n\\mid f(x) = 1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G ="}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D + \\bar{D}_{\\circ}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 由于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个Bent函数，所以有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.322, 0.912, 0.645, 0.933], "content": "D \\bar {D} ^ {(- 1)} + \\bar {D} D ^ {(- 1)} = 2 ^ {n - 1} (G - 0)"}]}, {"page_idx": 144, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.105, 0.056, 0.142, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "132"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.426, 0.055, 0.587, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.071, 0.095, 0.914, 0.116], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u = |D|"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|D| = 2^n - u"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，而且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2u(2^n - u) = 2^{n-1}(2^n - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。整理该等式，得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.364, 0.126, 0.649, 0.143], "content": "u ^ {2} - 2 ^ {n} u + 2 ^ {n - 2} (2 ^ {n} - 1) = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.071, 0.155, 0.469, 0.173], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解这个二次方程,得到  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "u = 2^{n-1} \\pm 2^{n/2-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.116, 0.183, 0.272, 0.201], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "另一方面，又有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.318, 0.215, 0.695, 0.264], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} D D ^ {(- 1)} & = (D - G) (D - G) ^ {(- 1)} \\\\ & = D D ^ {(- 1)} - (| G | - 2 | D |) G \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.071, 0.273, 0.351, 0.292], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "将该式代入式(3.2)中,得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.28, 0.301, 0.732, 0.347], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} 2 D D ^ {(- 1)} & = (2 ^ {n - 1} + | G | - 2 | D |) G + 2 ^ {n - 1} \\cdot 0 \\\\ & = (2 ^ {n} \\mp 2 ^ {n / 2}) G + 2 ^ {n - 1} \\cdot 0 \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.073, 0.357, 0.149, 0.375], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "进而有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.327, 0.385, 0.936, 0.403], "content": "D D ^ {(- 1)} = 2 ^ {n - 2} \\cdot 0 + (2 ^ {n - 2} \\mp 2 ^ {n / 2 - 1}) G\\tag{3.3}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.072, 0.413, 0.939, 0.461], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "所以根据引理 3.3 的性质(2)，就证明了 D 是一个  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(2^{n}, 2^{n-1} \\pm 2^{n/2-1}, 2^{n-2} \\pm 2^{n/2-1})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  - 差集。\n由于 D 中所含元素的个数是一个正整数，所以得到 n 是偶数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.072, 0.469, 0.942, 0.516], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "充分性的证明只是根据式(3.3)来证明式(3.1)和式(3.2)，这个过程留给读者去验证。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.073, 0.525, 0.941, 0.571], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bent 函数在编码和密码等领域都有着重要的应用。该函数一个最重要的性质, 就是它与所有线性函数的距离都“比较远”。下面给出“比较远”的精确数学描述。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.073, 0.58, 0.943, 0.661], "content": [{"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}\\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的仿射函数就是形如  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_{a,b}(x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots x_{n}):a_{1}x_{1}+a_{2}x_{2}+\\cdots+a_{n}x_{n}+b"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的映射，这里  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\boldsymbol{a}=(a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{n})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中的某个向量，b=0 或 1。可以通过通常的点积  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle a,x\\rangle+b"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  来表示函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l_{a,b}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}\\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上两个函数 f,g 之间的 Hamming 距离定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.305, 0.672, 0.714, 0.691], "content": "d _ {H} (f, g) = | \\{x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n} \\mid f (x) \\neq g (x) \\} |"}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.074, 0.7, 0.602, 0.719], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "一个函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 到所有仿射函数构成的集合的距离定义为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.414, 0.729, 0.601, 0.761], "content": "\\min _ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}, b \\in F _ {2}} d _ {H} (f, l _ {a, b})"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.075, 0.766, 0.472, 0.784], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "称这个值为 f 的非线性度, 记为 NL(f)。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.075, 0.793, 0.94, 0.842], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面将证明,当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为偶数时,Bent函数是非线性度最高的函数。对于任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f:F_2^n\\to F_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以定义 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n}\\rightarrow \\{-1,1\\} \\subseteq \\mathbb{C}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上函数"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.419, 0.852, 0.598, 0.87], "content": "F (x) = (- 1) ^ {\\bar {f} (x)}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.075, 0.881, 0.942, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值被看成了 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{C}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的一个自然对应（否则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的0，1不能作为指数）。"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 处的Walsh-Hadamard变换定义为"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 145, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.397, 0.063, 0.56, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.841, 0.065, 0.879, 0.078], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "133"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.331, 0.098, 0.622, 0.137], "content": "W _ {f} (a) = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} F (x) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x \\rangle}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.048, 0.142, 0.078, 0.159], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.339, 0.17, 0.617, 0.209], "content": "W _ {f} (\\bar {a}) = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {f (x) + \\langle \\bar {a}, x \\rangle}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.046, 0.213, 0.312, 0.231], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "经过简单的计算,可以得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.294, 0.243, 0.662, 0.274], "content": "d _ {H} (f, l _ {a, b}) = 2 ^ {n - 1} - (- 1) ^ {b} \\frac {1}{2} W _ {f} (a)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.047, 0.286, 0.102, 0.304], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "因此"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.305, 0.315, 0.652, 0.353], "content": "\\mathrm{NL} (f) = 2 ^ {n - 1} - \\frac {1}{2} \\max _ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} | W _ {f} (a) |"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.091, 0.359, 0.601, 0.377], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Walsh-Hadamard 变换有着重要的性质, 即引理 3.5。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.093, 0.393, 0.52, 0.411], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理3.5 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\in F_2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "l(x) = \\langle b, x \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，那么"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.357, 0.423, 0.6, 0.47], "content": "W _ {l} (a) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 2 ^ {n} & a = b \\\\ 0 & a \\neq b \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.092, 0.486, 0.358, 0.504], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 根据上面的定义,有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.221, 0.514, 0.737, 0.553], "content": "W _ {l} (a) = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, x \\rangle} (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x \\rangle} = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b + a, x \\rangle}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.048, 0.559, 0.914, 0.605], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a + b \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\langle a + b, x \\rangle"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个非零的线性映射, 因此它将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的元素映成 0 , 另外 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "2^{n-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的元素映成 1 。进而此时 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "W_{l}(a) = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.093, 0.616, 0.489, 0.634], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a + b = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，显然 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "W_{l}(a) = 2^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.092, 0.644, 0.582, 0.662], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据引理 3.5 可以证明 Walsh-Hadamard 逆变换。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.094, 0.679, 0.665, 0.698], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "引理3.6 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y \\in F_2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_2^n \\to F_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个函数。则有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.294, 0.709, 0.663, 0.748], "content": "\\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} W _ {f} (a) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} = (- 1) ^ {f (y)} \\cdot 2 ^ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.092, 0.761, 0.642, 0.779], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F(x) = (-1)^{f(x)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，直接利用引理3.5计算，得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.192, 0.792, 0.768, 0.935], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} W _ {f} (a) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} & = \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} \\left[ \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} F (x) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x \\rangle} \\right] (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} F (x) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x + y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} F (x) \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x + y \\rangle} \\end{array}"}]}, {"page_idx": 146, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.098, 0.06, 0.136, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "134"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.418, 0.058, 0.58, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.435, 0.093, 0.564, 0.11], "content": "= F (y) \\cdot 2 ^ {n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.065, 0.148, 0.932, 0.195], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "下面给出 Bent 函数的一个等价条件。引理 3.5 并不会直接应用到下面定理的证明中,但是它的证明思想会在充分性的证明中使用到。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.108, 0.211, 0.931, 0.23], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理3.17 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为正偶数。函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f: F_2^n \\to F_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是Bent函数当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|W_f(a)| = 2^{n/2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.108, 0.247, 0.522, 0.265], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 （必要性）根据 Bent 函数的定义，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.281, 0.275, 0.716, 0.491], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} (W _ {f} (a)) ^ {2} & = \\left[ \\sum_ {x} (- 1) ^ {f (x) + \\langle x, a \\rangle} \\right] ^ {2} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {x, y} (- 1) ^ {f (x) + f (y) + \\langle y + x, a \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {b} \\sum_ {x} (- 1) ^ {f (x + b) + f (x) + \\langle b, a \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {b} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, a \\rangle} \\sum_ {x} (- 1) ^ {f (x + b) + f (x)} \\\\ & = (- 1) ^ {\\langle 0, a \\rangle} 2 ^ {n} \\\\ & = 2 ^ {n} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.068, 0.503, 0.273, 0.522], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|W_{f}(a)| = 2^{n / 2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.066, 0.54, 0.934, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(充分性)要证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 Bent 函数, 根据定义, 只要证明对于任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x + a) + f(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是平衡的, 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.382, 0.595, 0.62, 0.635], "content": "\\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {f (x + a) + f (x)} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.111, 0.641, 0.686, 0.679], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G(a) = \\sum_{x\\in F_2^n}(-1)^{f(x + a) + f(x)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，根据必要性证明的部分，有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.176, 0.685, 0.825, 0.716], "content": "(W _ {f} (a)) ^ {2} = \\sum_ {b} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, a \\rangle} \\sum_ {x} (- 1) ^ {f (x + b) + f (x)} = \\sum_ {b} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, a \\rangle} G (b)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.067, 0.724, 0.58, 0.743], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "进一步，取任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y \\in F_2^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(W_f(a))^2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 进行逆变换"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.205, 0.754, 0.797, 0.9], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\sum_ {a} (W _ {f} (a)) ^ {2} (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} & = \\sum_ {a} \\left[ \\sum_ {b} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, a \\rangle} G (b) \\right] (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {b} \\sum_ {a} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b, a \\rangle} G (b) (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {b} G (b) \\sum_ {a} (- 1) ^ {\\langle b + y, a \\rangle} \\\\ & = G (y) \\cdot 2 ^ {n} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.069, 0.911, 0.756, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意到此时 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|W_{f}(a)| = 2^{n / 2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，于是上式的左边等于0，所以 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G(y) = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 147, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.41, 0.063, 0.572, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第3章 组合数学"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.854, 0.065, 0.892, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "135"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.059, 0.1, 0.925, 0.164], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于 Bent 函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，通过简单的求和计算，有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\sum_{a \\in F_2^n} W_f^2(a) = 2^{2n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。这一公式对任意的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_2^n \\to F_2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的函数都成立，该等式称为 Parseval 恒等式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.181, 0.763, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 3.18 设 f 是从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n} \\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的任一函数, 它满足 Parseval 恒等式"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.399, 0.208, 0.576, 0.248], "content": "\\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} W _ {f} ^ {2} (a) = 2 ^ {2 n}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.103, 0.259, 0.157, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.232, 0.285, 0.747, 0.445], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} W _ {f} ^ {2} (a) & = \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {f (x) + \\langle a, x \\rangle} \\sum_ {y \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {f (y) + \\langle a, y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {x \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} \\sum_ {y \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {f (x) + f (y)} \\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x + y \\rangle} \\\\ & = \\sum_ {x = y} 2 ^ {n} \\\\ & = 2 ^ {2 n} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.061, 0.456, 0.382, 0.475], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上面倒数第二个等号成立是因为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.346, 0.484, 0.64, 0.534], "content": "\\sum_ {a \\in F _ {2} ^ {n}} (- 1) ^ {\\langle a, x \\rangle} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 2 ^ {n} & x = 0 \\\\ 0 & x \\neq 0 \\end{array} \\right."}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.061, 0.545, 0.927, 0.591], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据 Parseval 恒等式, 可以知道 Bent 函数是非线性度最高的函数。根据本节所学的内容, 最后对 Bent 函数的等价性条件做如下的总结。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.104, 0.606, 0.919, 0.625], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "推论 3.1 设 n 为正偶数，f 是从  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "F_{2}^{n} \\rightarrow F_{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的任一函数。以下的几个命题是等价的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.106, 0.634, 0.304, 0.652], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是Bent函数；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.105, 0.659, 0.855, 0.679], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D = \\{x\\in F_2^n\\mid f(x) = 0\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(2^{n},2^{n - 1}\\pm 2^{n / 2 - 1},2^{n - 2}